From 2735077f3d8de091fcd0aabd3fa65ba39f9b5621 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nikuzo <buelaniki@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 20:10:40 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] Add a pattern lock mode (-P / --pattern)

Swipe through a visible 3x3 grid of dots, Android style, instead of
tapping invisible quadrants. The passcode uses the 3x3 grid's digits
(1 = topleft, 9 = bottomright); crossing a dot halfway between two
connected ones picks it up too. A wrong pattern shows in red for a second
and counts towards the deep lock, like a wrong touch passcode.
